{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29435","headline":"落花 · 李商隐","name":"落花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高阁客竟去，小园花乱飞。\n参差连曲陌，迢遰送斜晖。\n肠断未忍扫，眼穿仍欲归。\n芳心向春尽，所得是沾衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29435.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29435","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据刘学锴《唐诗鉴赏辞典》“落花”条（上海辞书出版社，1983 年版）、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"据刘学锴《唐诗鉴赏辞典》“落花”条（上海辞书出版社，1983 年版）"}